# Strategies

- Class with `strategy_id` and `calculate()` → `SignalResult` / `StrategyDecision`
- Use prepared Polars columns on `PreparedSymbol`; no pandas on hot path
- Shared logic in `spec_patterns.py` / `setups/` — do not duplicate indicators
- Zero hits: telemetry triage before threshold changes; run `live_check_strategies.py`
- Fix broken strategies; do not set `enabled=False` without documented reason in config
